	(text "USB-C INPUT + PD SINK (CH224A)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "39323282-ab9f-445b-b9a9-990a7dbff7fc")
	)
	(text "9 V PD: R29 6.8 k on CFG1 asks a USB-PD charger for 9 V;\na plain 5 V source stays at 5 V (charging is slower).\nCH224A pin 1 is VHV (32 V): VBUS goes straight in, C17 decouples it.\nCFG2/CFG3, DP/DM and PG are unused (D+/D- belong to the MCU).\nD1 SMBJ20A clamps VBUS. D+/D- continue on the MCU & USB sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 99.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "10db4b56-0697-4971-8865-71a50f45a74f")
	)
	(text "3S CHARGER (BQ25798)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.48 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c1228740-c7b0-4703-9782-25af3abb8488")
	)
	(text "CHARGE SAFETY WITHOUT FIRMWARE\nPROG: R31 13.7 k selects 3S (12.6 V) at 750 kHz.\nILIM_HIZ: R32/R33 (100 k / 33 k from REGN) set 1.24 V, an input\nlimit of about 0.30 A. Charge current stays near 0.45C of a\n500 mAh pack from 9 V (less from 5 V), even though the\npower-on charge-current default is 1 A.\nTS: R34/R35 with the pack's 10 k NTC (J2) give JEITA limits.\n/CE tied low: charging always on. /QON, D+/D- unused.\nNo ship FET: SDRV only has C36. BATP senses VBAT via R30.\nFirmware may raise the limits over I2C (GPIO12/13, /INT GPIO14)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 45.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c34c8fad-b374-46ba-a55c-ae1c50305296")
	)
	(text "MOTORS BYPASS THE CHARGER SYS\nVSYS (motors, 5 V buck) comes from the pack through F1 and Q1,\nnot from CHG_SYS: the BQ25798 BATFET is rated 6 A continuous,\nbelow the motor peaks. CHG_SYS only carries its own caps.\nCharging works with the power switch off.\nLED1 (green) is lit while charging, no firmware needed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ea545166-7b80-403e-8e8a-d66160721e32")
	)
	(text "I2C / INT PULL-UPS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bb253fbf-12e1-4b58-b07c-f58dd2caaf62")
	)
	(text "CHARGER CAPS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 218.44 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d1d03920-8174-4c08-b5ea-64c8118c7f70")
	)
	(text "BATTERY + POWER SWITCH"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "23d8ff63-0921-40ae-8cdd-c5eb6544d404")
	)
	(text "SW1 only drives Q1's gate; R40 holds Q1 off.\nMotor current flows through Q1 (AO4407A P-FET).\nF1: 15 A slow-blow at the pack. The charger\nconnects at VBAT, ahead of the switch."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ed35c5b9-9518-4f06-b081-ab0d6bf106f5")
	)
	(text "3.3 V RAIL (USB OR BATTERY)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 259.08 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "58706536-699b-44e5-b519-7b919ad42e96")
	)
	(text "U8 makes 5 V from VBUS (up to 30 V in), so the MCU runs from USB\nalone: program it with a flat pack or the switch off.\nD2/D3 OR that with the buck's VCC. Keep U8's load to the MCU (~50 mA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 259.08 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "603a8477-ca30-455a-b5da-96fb9e69efb0")
	)
	(text "ERC FLAG"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 358.14 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "53b75599-60a8-4518-8d87-729f9efce543")
	)
